[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/880659181","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1095#issuecomment-880659181","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1095","id":880659181,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg4MDY1OTE4MQ==","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-07-15T12:37:16Z","updated_at":"2021-07-15T12:37:16Z","body":"Hi @herlesupreeth \r\n\r\nThis issue was caused by the GTPv1-U Error Indication during GTPv2-C Delete Bearer Request/Response. At that time, bearer->xact is overwritten in the MME context. \r\n\r\nThis problem happened like this:\r\n1. SGW-C sends GTPv2-C Delete Bearer Request.\r\n2. eNB sends GTPv1-U Error Indication\r\n3. SGW-C sends Downlink Data Notification\r\n4. MME OVERWIRTES bearer->xact context.\r\n5. MME sends GTPv2-C Delete Bearer Response with an Invalid sequence number.\r\n6. SGW-C crashed.\r\n\r\nSo I fixed MME to not overwrite bearer-xact.\r\n\r\nBut I don't know why the eNB sent an error indication in that situation. See packet number 9862, 9863, 9864. So, first of all, I modified it up to here in the main branch and uploaded it.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you find any other issues.\r\n\r\nThank you so much for sharing this issue.\r\nSukchan\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/880659181/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/880667486","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1095#issuecomment-880667486","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1095","id":880667486,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg4MDY2NzQ4Ng==","user":{"login":"herlesupreeth","id":4115839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMTU4Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4115839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth","html_url":"https://github.com/herlesupreeth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-07-15T12:50:27Z","updated_at":"2021-07-15T12:50:27Z","body":"Thank you @acetcom . Will test it and let you know","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/880667486/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/880795063","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1095#issuecomment-880795063","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1095","id":880795063,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg4MDc5NTA2Mw==","user":{"login":"herlesupreeth","id":4115839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMTU4Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4115839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth","html_url":"https://github.com/herlesupreeth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-07-15T15:32:00Z","updated_at":"2021-07-15T15:32:00Z","body":"I took a fresh trace and SGWC is not crashing.\r\n\r\nIn the attached trace i see Error indication on GTPv1-U from eNB, could be it be because of GTP packets from packet number 4914-4918? since the bearer with e-RAB Id 12 for both UEs (enb-ue-s1ap-id 11, mme-ue-s1ap-id 19) and (enb-ue-s1ap-id 1, mme-ue-s1ap-id 9) was released in packet 4897 and 4907.\r\n[sgwc_crash_epc2.zip](https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/files/6824368/sgwc_crash_epc2.zip)\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/880795063/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/881092219","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1095#issuecomment-881092219","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1095","id":881092219,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM40hGZ7","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-07-16T00:28:06Z","updated_at":"2021-07-16T00:28:06Z","body":"I am studying the standard document for that part. For your information, open5gs is implemented like this:\r\n\r\n1. SMF(PGW-C) sends Delete Bearer Request to the SGW-C.\r\n2. SGW-C sends Delete Bearer Request to the MME.\r\n3. MME sends E-RABReleaseCommand and Deactivate EPS bearer context request to the eNB.\r\n4. eNB sends E-RABReleaseResponse and Deactivate EPS bearer context accept to the eNB.\r\n5. MME sends Delete Bearer Response to the SGW-C\r\n6. SGW-C sends PFCP Session Modification Request to the SGW-U\r\n7. SGW-U sends PFCP Session Modification Response to the SGW-C\r\n8. SGW-C sends Delete Bearer Response to the SMF(PGW-C) \r\n\r\nBearer context is removed during 6 and 7 step. At that time, EPC can stop sending data traffic to the eNB.\r\n\r\nHowever, your eNB seems to want to behave like this:\r\n\r\n1. SMF(PGW-C) sends Delete Bearer Request to the SGW-C.\r\n2. SGW-C sends PFCP Session Modification Request to the SGW-U\r\n3. SGW-U sends PFCP Session Modification Response to the SGW-C\r\n4. SGW-C sends Delete Bearer Request to the MME.\r\n5. MME sends E-RABReleaseCommand and Deactivate EPS bearer context request to the eNB.\r\n6. eNB sends E-RABReleaseResponse and Deactivate EPS bearer context accept to the eNB.\r\n7. MME sends Delete Bearer Response to the SGW-C\r\n8. SGW-C sends Delete Bearer Response to the SMF(PGW-C) \r\n\r\nIt seems that eNB wants to stop data traffic in advance and request E-RAB Release to the eNB. To do this, we need to perform the PFCP Session Modification process as in step 2 and 3 above.\r\n\r\nI've been looking for how to implement this in standard since yesterday, but I haven't found it yet.\r\n\r\nI'll post again if I find out.\r\n\r\nThanks a lot!\r\nSukchan\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/881092219/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/881279692","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1095#issuecomment-881279692","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1095","id":881279692,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM40h0LM","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-07-16T08:40:09Z","updated_at":"2021-07-16T08:40:09Z","body":"I've found some part of the standard related to this issue.\r\n\r\n```\r\nTS23.401 5.4.4.1 PDN GW initiated bearer deactivation\r\n\r\n9. If ISR is activated, after receiving the two Delete Bearer Response messages from the MME and the SGSN, or if\r\nISR is not activated, after receiving the Delete Bearer Response messages from the MME, the Serving GW\r\ndeletes the bearer context related to the deactivated EPS bearer acknowledges the bearer deactivation to the PDN\r\nGW by sending a Delete Bearer Response (EPS Bearer Identity, User Location Information (ECGI or CGI/SAI),\r\nSecondary RAT usage data) message. ...\r\n```\r\n\r\nSGW should delete the bearer context after receiving Delete Bearer Response from MME. Therefore, eNB should not send GTPv1-U Error Indication before sending E-RABReleaseResponse + Deactivate EPS bearer context accept .\r\n\r\nI'll leave open5gs as is.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you have any other problem.\r\n\r\nThanks a lot!\r\nSukchan\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/881279692/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/881311387","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1095#issuecomment-881311387","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1095","id":881311387,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM40h76b","user":{"login":"herlesupreeth","id":4115839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMTU4Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4115839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth","html_url":"https://github.com/herlesupreeth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/herlesupreeth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-07-16T09:31:31Z","updated_at":"2021-07-16T09:31:31Z","body":"Thank you for the clarification","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/881311387/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]]